  </section><section class="wrap section">
    <div class="prose legal">
      <p class="notice">
        Draft for launch review. This page requires the operator's legal details
        and review for the chosen jurisdiction before paid services are offered.
      </p><h2>What the website offers</h2><p>
        Real product offers human product and engineering reviews of AI-built
        products. Sending a form requests a conversation. It is not a purchase
        or an agreement to begin paid work.
      </p><h2>Scope and payment</h2><p>
        The scope, deliverables, timeline and fee must be agreed separately
        before a Reality Check or Reality Sprint begins. No definitive price is
        published in this version.
      </p><h2>Limits of a review</h2><p>
        A review is based on the agreed scope and the product made available. It
        is not a penetration test, compliance certification or guarantee that
        all defects will be found. Findings may include a recommendation to
        consult a specialist.
      </p><h2>Access and ownership</h2><p>
        Share only resources you are authorised to share. Repository access and
        handling of confidential information are agreed separately. The product
        remains yours.
      </p><h2>Details to complete</h2><p>
        [REQUIRED BEFORE LAUNCH: contracting entity, address, contact, governing
        law, cancellation and refund terms, consumer rights where applicable,
        liability provisions and dispute resolution.]
      </p>
    </div>
  </section></Base
